<!-- Inlined, not <img src>. The wordmark's lettering is fill="currentColor" so it can follow the page's text
     colour; inside an <img> that resolves against the image's own context instead and renders black, which is
     invisible on the dark navy background. ../website/layouts/partials/logo.html inlines it for the same reason.
     The badge keeps its own brand colours -- only the lettering is currentColor. -->
